scn 1
# A 150-body ground stream walks through 24 idle landed own flyers that stand
# on its straight way: the flyers should lift for the stream and land again
# (once each). Scaled-up liftflyers mode 0 (12 flyers, 40 bodies). The order is
# given at tick 90, after the VTOL-standby flyers have landed (as the world test
# waits). Observer: g.F.takeoffs_max / relifts / go_arounds / illegal_overlap_ticks,
# g.G.* arrival.
name liftstream
ticks 3600
seed 7
players 2
team 0 0
team 1 1
map flat 200 100
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
type f flyer 2 1200 1 4 cruise=80
group F 0 f 24 rect 70 42 88 60 pitch=3
group G 0 m 150 rect 20 28 50 76 pitch=3
at 90 move G 160 50
gate mid 100 20 100 80
line far 140 0 140 100
region goal 140 30 180 70
